{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pip Puzzle",
    "steam_appid": 1858390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/be35e6423f51e4073303c386cf0d427f.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Harness the unique skills of each character! Net gems and relocate them, or smash through layers of gems. Maybe you want to crush your opponents' gems by dropping balls on them. Or perhaps you\u2019d like to torment your opponent instead by turning their gems black and white for a few turns. The choice is yours.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/e5bd7a32027022a327e0fd7724d82993.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    As you play each stage, everything changes. The visuals evolve, as well as the music. An icy excavation site floods with lava, a dystopian Tokyo grows murky with fog, and a scrapyard in space comes to life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.poster.avif?t=1754572562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.webm?t=1754572562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.mp4?t=1754572562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2fd33d10ad11b4b18dc7bac1f8e3f6db.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Break friendships with your preferred character, or make new enemies in online matchmaking.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/c1c85616f37e6d8bc8952180af25197d.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Choose your favorite character, from a bad-mannered witch with even worse-mannered hair, an electronic life form with reality warping powers, or a split-personality, teetering between beast and bot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/3e064893a13c178010c844198b8e3c40.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/be35e6423f51e4073303c386cf0d427f.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Harness the unique skills of each character! Net gems and relocate them, or smash through layers of gems. Maybe you want to crush your opponents' gems by dropping balls on them. Or perhaps you\u2019d like to torment your opponent instead by turning their gems black and white for a few turns. The choice is yours.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/e5bd7a32027022a327e0fd7724d82993.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    As you play each stage, everything changes. The visuals evolve, as well as the music. An icy excavation site floods with lava, a dystopian Tokyo grows murky with fog, and a scrapyard in space comes to life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.poster.avif?t=1754572562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.webm?t=1754572562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2e7427ffda246818af37aff9083b8c32.mp4?t=1754572562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/2fd33d10ad11b4b18dc7bac1f8e3f6db.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Break friendships with your preferred character, or make new enemies in online matchmaking.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/c1c85616f37e6d8bc8952180af25197d.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div><br>    Choose your favorite character, from a bad-mannered witch with even worse-mannered hair, an electronic life form with reality warping powers, or a split-personality, teetering between beast and bot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858390/extras/3e064893a13c178010c844198b8e3c40.webp?t=1754572562\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Pip Puzzle is an action puzzle gem game where you flood your opponent\u2019s side with gems by smashing your own gems. Fight through Arcade, or play online against your friends. Find a character with a unique skill that best fits your play style, and battle through stages that evolve while you play!",
